ace $z=f(x,y)$ with the plane $x=3.$ Hence, the slope of the tangent to the curve $C$ at the point $P(3,-4,-6)$ will be given by the partial derivative ${f}_{y}(3,-4).$\n\nTo get the slope, we evaluate the partial derivative ${f}_{y}(x,y)$ at $(3,-4):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{y}(3,-4) & =\\frac{3(3)}{(-4)}-3(3)^2(-4)+3\\cos(\\pi (-4)) \\\\  & =(- \\frac{9}{4})+(108)+(3) \\\\  & =\\frac{435}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["03f390c2-4771-5faa-ac0b-de2b80cc6c4f"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "90b8c762-bb00-5ee2-818b-b20f30c445b4" :answer/id #uuid "90b8c762-bb00-5ee2-818b-b20f30c445b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- \\frac{689}{4}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "549f41d6-51c7-5517-9880-fab5a7a59aa4" :answer/id #uuid "549f41d6-51c7-5517-9880-fab5a7a59aa4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-176" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6303147b-f923-5be7-ac2a-8730ba0191eb" :answer/id #uuid "6303147b-f923-5be7-ac2a-8730ba0191eb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{31}{4}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7d793631-7895-5189-82cd-1f1f5696b445" :answer/id #uuid "7d793631-7895-5189-82cd-1f1f5696b445" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-161" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4547b393-5bae-5612-839b-4a8ce330ff97" :answer/id #uuid "4547b393-5bae-5612-839b-4a8ce330ff97" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{751}{4}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "53661b93-7310-57de-95f8-8c1becf1524d" :answer-field/id #uuid "53661b93-7310-57de-95f8-8c1becf1524d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["90b8c762-bb00-5ee2-818b-b20f30c445b4" "549f41d6-51c7-5517-9880-fab5a7a59aa4" "6303147b-f923-5be7-ac2a-8730ba0191eb" "7d793631-7895-5189-82cd-1f1f5696b445" "4547b393-5bae-5612-839b-4a8ce330ff97"] :answer-field/correct "90b8c762-bb00-5ee2-818b-b20f30c445b4" :db/ensure :answer-fiel